# Local settings. Copy this to .env (gitignored) and fill it in. In a
# codespace the key comes from your Codespaces secret instead.

# aityx.ai (https://aityx.ai/docs): the API key, from the console's API
# keys page; the same key as Mortgage Hub's. A secret: only the API reads
# it, and it must never reach the Flutter app (anything compiled in is
# readable in the web bundle). Routing needs it.
AITYX_API_KEY=
# The API's base URL. Empty: https://api.aityx.ai, the one the docs name.
# A stage key works only on stage: https://console-stage.aityx.ai.
AITYX_URL=

# The local model that reads the request, on Ollama (https://ollama.com).
# Where Ollama answers; empty: http://127.0.0.1:11434, Ollama's default.
# `devbox services up` starts one there unless one already answers.
OLLAMA_URL=
# The model, as `ollama pull` names it; empty: qwen3:1.7b (about 1.4 GB).
# Any model that follows a JSON schema works; smaller is faster, larger
# reads better.
OLLAMA_MODEL=
